@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Loggers and their effective levels (root INFO, app INFO)
GET {{base}}/logging/loggers

### 2. DEBUG on app.orders while it's INFO -> written: false (one comparison, nothing built)
POST {{base}}/logging/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "logger": "app.orders", "level": "DEBUG", "message": "cart validated", "fields": { "lines": 3 } }

### 3. Turn DEBUG on for app.orders at runtime (children inherit)
PUT {{base}}/logging/loggers/app.orders/level
Content-Type: application/json

{ "level": "DEBUG" }

### 4. Now it's written
POST {{base}}/logging/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "logger": "app.orders.cart", "level": "DEBUG", "message": "cart validated", "fields": { "lines": 3 } }

### 5. Secrets in fields are redacted
POST {{base}}/logging/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "logger": "app.payment", "level": "INFO", "message": "charging", "fields": { "amountPaise": 177000, "cardNumber": "4111111111111111" } }

### 6. Demo request flow: same requestId on every line, across awaits, without passing it
POST {{base}}/logging/demo/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
x-request-id: req-demo-1

{ "fail": true }

### 7. Query the in-memory ring buffer
GET {{base}}/logging/entries?requestId=req-demo-1

###
GET {{base}}/logging/entries?level=ERROR

### 8. Back to inheriting
PUT {{base}}/logging/loggers/app.orders/level
Content-Type: application/json

{ "level": null }

### 9. Stats: lines per level, appender errors, dropped
GET {{base}}/logging/stats
